'''Jimmy''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Security Hall}}. He appears as a "recruit" while {{NPCSprite|Brigette}} talks about account security, but is quickly detained after admitting to fighting the {{NPCSprite|Security Sloth}}.

